<title>FINLAND: Finnish April jobless rate rises to 16.6 percent. [CORRECTED 06:10 GMT]</title>
<headline>Finnish April jobless rate rises to 16.6 percent. [CORRECTED 06:10 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish unemployment rate rose 0.7 percentage points year-on-year to 16.6 percent in April, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>			 April 1997    March 1997     April 1996</p>
<p> Unemployed	   424,000	  397,000	 410,000</p>
<p> Jobless rate (pct)  16.6	     15.9	    15.9</p>
<p>(Corrects rate in April 1996 to 15.9 from 16.5.)</p>
<p>The figures are not seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>Finland's labour ministry, calculating on a different basis, earlier said the April 1997 unemployment rate fell to 16.1 percent from 17.3 percent in March.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
